        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jeff Bhasker, The-Dream\n- Songs: \"Carry On,\" \"Single Ladies (Put a Ring on It)\"\n- Albums: Some Nights, Love vs. Money\n- Awards: Grammy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Jeff Bhasker produced the Fun song \"Carry On\" on the album Some Nights.\n- Jeff Bhasker won a Grammy Award for \"Single Ladies (Put a Ring on It).\"\n- \"Single Ladies (Put a Ring on It)\" was the fourth single from The-Dream's album Love vs. Money.",
