        "original_id": "517697ff-cf1e-5b9e-a545-82c5426573a1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jeff Bhasker, Jay-Z, Kanye West, Nate Ruess, Andrew Dost, Jack Antonoff\n- Groups: Fun\n- Songs: \"Run This Town,\" \"All of the Lights,\" \"We Are Young,\" \"Carry On\"\n- Albums: My Beautiful Dark Twisted Fantasy\n- Roles: record producer, songwriter, keyboardist, vocalist, multi-instrumentalist\n\nFacts:\n- Jeff Bhasker is an American record producer, songwriter, keyboardist, vocalist, and multi-instrumentalist, and he is also known as Billy Kraven and U.G.L.Y.\n- In 2010, Kanye West released \"All of the Lights\" as the fourth single from his fifth studio album, My Beautiful Dark Twisted Fantasy.\n- Jeff Bhasker has won Grammy Awards for the songs \"Run This Town\" by Jay-Z, \"All of the Lights\" by Kanye West, and \"We Are Young\" by Fun.\n- The song \"Carry On\" was written by Fun members Nate Ruess, Andrew Dost, and Jack Antonoff alongside the album's producer, Jeff Bhasker.",
